# Lit only by a glowing thing (docs/apps/raytrace.md, "Example scenes"): no light and no sky, a ball
# that glows, and round it things of other materials, lit by it.
camera target 0 0.35 0 turn 15 tilt 24 far 3 lens 0.6
background power 0
object Ground plane scale 4 colour 0.75 0.75 0.75
object "Glowing ball" ball kind glow colour 1 0.62 0.3 glow 20 scale 0.7 place 0 0.35 0
object Teapot /root/Models/teapot.obj fit 0.9 move -0.85 0 -0.25 colour 0.8 0.8 0.8
object Rabbit /root/Models/bunny.ply fit 0.75 move 0.8 0 -0.4 kind plastic colour 0.3 0.75 0.4
object Mirror ball kind mirror colour 0.95 0.95 0.95 scale 0.45 place 0.35 0.225 0.75
object Knot /root/Models/knot.obj fit 0.55 move -0.4 0 0.75 kind metal rough 0.3 colour 0.9 0.9 0.95
